mindmap
  root((Inheritance and Protocols))
    Basic Inheritance
      class Child(Parent)
      Inherits all attributes and methods
      Override parent methods
      Extend with new methods
    super builtin
      Call parent constructor
      Delegate to parent methods
      Works with MRO
    MRO C3 Linearization
      Child before parent
      Base class order preserved
      D.__mro__ inspection
      Diamond problem resolution
    Multiple Inheritance
      class D(B, C)
      MRO determines dispatch
      Explicit is better than implicit
    Mixins
      Small reusable behavior classes
      Add cross-cutting functionality
      JSONMixin, LogMixin examples
    Abstract Base Classes
      from abc import ABC, abstractmethod
      Define interface contracts
      Cannot be instantiated
      Force subclass implementation
    Protocols
      Structural subtyping
      from typing import Protocol
      Duck typing with static checks
      No explicit inheritance needed
